	"Description": "this mod is made to set the dialogue font size from 0.01x to 10x native(1-100)\u00A0\u00A0\u00A0(only for some language)\n<br />\n<br />you can change the font size by editing\u00A0\"fontSize\" in your config.json in your mod folder\n<br />\n<br />if there is no config.json, create one and paste below into it:[code]{\n<br />\u00A0 \"fontSize\": 50.0\n<br />}\n<br />[/code]\n<br />or you can use Generic Mod Config to set size in game\n<br />\n<br />本mod用于设置对话字体大小\n<br />\n<br />你可以通过编辑\u00A0config.json\u00A0中的\u00A0fontSize\u00A0来更改字体大小\n<br />\n<br />如果没有config.json文件，请自己创建一个该文件并将英文部分的代码段粘贴进去并保存\n<br />\n<br />或者你也可以使用Generic Mod Config来在游戏中设置字体大小",
